dition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.17.3.1 and Thm.17.3.2, printed pp.516–517 / PDF pp.536–537"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_H\">\\(\\dim_H\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supergale}_s\">\\(\\mathrm{Supergale}_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSC}\">\\(\\mathrm{LSC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Success}^s\">\\(\\mathrm{Success}^s\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9049b31bf7443246\" href=\"?note=9049b31bf7443246\" title=\"43-df-s-supergale\">43-df-s-supergale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" href=\"?note=22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" title=\"43-df-sgale-success\">43-df-sgale-success</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_H(X)=\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\exists d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;[\\mathrm{Supergale}_s(d)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(d)\\land\\mathrm{Success}^s(d,X)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_H(X)=\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\exists d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;[\\mathrm{Supergale}_s(d)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(d)\\land\\mathrm{Success}^s(d,X)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>实质纠错：原来把 s 限在[0,1]，对 ML 随机点成功集合为空而 inf=∞。改为全部非负有理 s，并用书中通用 c.e. supermartingale 版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effhausdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-s-supergale","status":"resolved","id":"9049b31bf7443246","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-s-supergale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sgale-success","status":"resolved","id":"22bbacf3e5b5ce70","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sgale-success]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\dim_H$、$\\mathrm{Supergale}_s$、$\\mathrm{LSC}$、$\\mathrm{Success}^s$ 见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-s-supergale]]、[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-s-supergale","status":"resolved","id":"9049b31bf7443246","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\dim_H$、$\\mathrm{Supergale}_s$、$\\mathrm{LSC}$、$\\mathrm{Success}^s$ 见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-s-supergale]]、[[43-df-lower-semicomputab